<title>USA: Genovese Drug Q4 shr up.</title>
<headline>Genovese Drug Q4 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>FISCAL YEAR		  JAN 31, 1997		FEB 2, 1996</p>
<p> SALES			  $695,298,000	     $612,279,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME		     10,401,000	    7,607,000 (b)</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER</p>
<p>  COMMON SHARE		     .85 (a)		 .62 (a)(b)</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF COMMON</p>
<p>  SHARES OUTSTANDING	  12,244,000  (a)    12,194,000 (a)</p>
<p> FOURTH QUARTER	     JAN 31, 1997		FEB 2, 1996</p>
<p> SALES			   179,575,000		157,311,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME			4,949,000		  3,003,000</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER</p>
<p>  COMMON SHARE		     .40 (a)		    .25 (a)</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF COMMON</p>
<p>  SHARES OUTSTANDING    12,295,000 (a)	   12,199,000 (a)</p>
<p>(a) Adjusted, where appropriate, to retroactively reflect the effect of 10 percent stock dividends distributed on January 14, 1997 and January 4, 1996.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $722,000, or $.06 per common share from a gain on the sale of the nursing home division.</p>
